  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given system of equations are</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>It is given that the system of equations have infinite solutions.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#8710;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mo>&#8710;</mo><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>15</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>18</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>15</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>b</mi></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn></math></p><p>Hence, this is the correct option.</p></blockquote>",
